// RT15 (2026-10-04) — probe for the capture lane. Queue: docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-10-04-rt15-presentation.md
// Chart: NYSE:RDDT 1D from the listing.
// ⚠️ Not compiled on TradingView yet: if a row does not compile, the error names the line — split it out.
//
// Q-RT15d — the GRADIENT form of `fill` (smoothed-gaussian-trend-filter-algoalpha,
// heikin-ashi-true-strength-index-…-erebor): `fill(p1, p2, top_value, bottom_value,
// top_color, bottom_color)`. Read the fill's plot entries in the capture (what the
// study lists for a gradient fill, and any per-bar values it records) and screenshot
// three bars at high zoom: is the colour interpolated LINEARLY in price between
// top_value and bottom_value, and is the band clipped to the two plots?
//@version=6
indicator("vw-rt15-gradient-fill", overlay = true)
m = ta.sma(close, 20)
d = ta.stdev(close, 20)
p1 = plot(m + d, "G01 upper")
p2 = plot(m - d, "G02 lower")
// G03: constant colours, values equal to the plots
fill(p1, p2, m + d, m - d, color.new(color.green, 0), color.new(color.red, 0), title = "G03 gradient fill")
// G04: per-bar colours (the algoalpha shape)
pm = plot(m, "G04 mid", display = display.none)
fill(pm, p1, m + d, m, close > m ? color.new(color.lime, 20) : color.new(color.orange, 20), color.new(color.gray, 90), title = "G05 gradient fill per-bar")
